▸ Methods, headers, status codes
--------------------------------
REQUEST headers (client → server)
--------------------------------
Content-Type
Format of the request body
application/json

Accept
What format the client wants back
application/json

Authorization
Authentication credentials
Bearer <token>

Accept-Language
Preferred response language
en-US, ar;q=0.9

User-Agent
Client software identifier
Mozilla/5.0 ...
---------------------------------
RESPONSE headers (server → client)
---------------------------------
Content-Type
Format of the response body
application/json; charset=utf-8

Location
URL of newly created resource
/api/products/42

Cache-Control
Caching directives
max-age=3600

WWW-Authenticate
Auth scheme on 401 responses
Bearer realm="api"

Access-Control-Allow-Origin
CORS — which origins are allowed
https://myapp.com
