▸ Content negotiation
----------------------
// Client A wants JSON
GET /api/products/1
Accept: application/json
→ Response: Content-Type: application/json  { "id": 1, "name": "Laptop" }
 
// Client B wants XML
GET /api/products/1
Accept: application/xml
→ Response: Content-Type: application/xml   <Product><Id>1</Id>...</Product>
 
// Client C sends multiple with quality weights (q=)
Accept: application/json;q=1.0, application/xml;q=0.8, */*;q=0.5
→ Server picks the highest-quality format it supports
